          ],
          "returnType": "void",
          "description": "Walks along the ground during the world's next advance, at the movement's maxSpeed times input: positive towards the right of up (+x for the default up), negative towards the left. input is clamped to [-1, 1]. In the air the same input steers sideways. Like a movement command it lasts until the world has advanced once, so issue it every fixed step; the last call before the world advances wins."
        },
